{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2023-05-01 16:51:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY VIRGINIA FILES FOR CUSTOMER RATE REDUCTION, SUBMITS LONG-TERM RELIABILITY PLAN TO STATE REGULATORS', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA. , MAY 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY VIRGINIA SUBMITTED PLANS WITH THE VIRGINIA STATE CORPORATION COMMISSION (SCC) TODAY THAT, IF APPROVED, WOULD PROVIDE $7 - $14 IN MONTHLY SAVINGS FOR THE TYPICAL RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMER BEGINNING JULY 1.'}